<title>USA: Template Software in 2.1 million shr IPO.</title>
<headline>Template Software in 2.1 million shr IPO.</headline>
<dateline>DULLES, Va. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Template Software Inc said on Wednesday it launched an initial public offering of 2.1 million shares priced at $16.</p>
<p>Template is a software company specializing in enterprise-wide, distributed software solutions.</p>
</text>
